	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hirose TM24RSG-5A-88 RJ45 8P8C, shielded, tab up, no LEDs, THT (LCSC C6285250). Recommended PCB mounting pattern, TM24R catalog 2022.1 p.3: 8 x d0.8 contacts in 3 rows (pins 3/6 on the front row, 2/5/7 4.00 mm behind, 1/4/8 6.54 mm behind), 4 x d1.63 outer shell holes (front pair 15.25 mm apart on the front row, rear pair 11 mm apart 8.925 mm behind), 2 x d1.63 separate ground spring holes 13.25 mm apart 6.00 mm behind. Board edge 2.6 mm in front of the front row (Dwgs.User line). Pin 1 on +X. Mouth toward +Y. Keep-outs = the catalog 'no conductive traces' areas. Pads 1, 8 and 11-14 use 0.15 mm rings: 1.56 mm minimum from a shield pad to a contact pad (TI SLUA454 1.5 mm).")
	(tags "RJ45 8P8C modular jack shielded Hirose TM24R")
